      "id": "claim_dc3f9edf9b0d4c0dad81f9952f3153e3",
      "statement": "Coverage D is a separate coverage determination from the property-repair decision: under the reviewed HO-3 and HO-6 forms, a covered loss must satisfy the particular Coverage D component’s habitability or civil-authority conditions before loss-of-use payment is available.",
