      "id": "claim_4d8f7f26cb204c9bac388b046c444ea4",
      "statement": "The reviewed HO-3 editions set Coverage D at 20% of the relevant dwelling or Coverage A limit, while the HO-6 (2023-02) sets it at 50% of Coverage A; each form treats its stated amount as a cap on loss-of-use payment rather than separate component limits.",
