    {
      "id": "claim_677e4a9ebad54dceaf1b7736e7e5bceb",
      "statement": "For HO-3 (2018-09), ALE is necessary, actually incurred increased living expense needed to maintain the normal standard of living after a covered loss renders the residence unfit; it is measured against pre-loss necessary expense and ends when the residence becomes fit to live in.",
