      "id": "claim_41f674bfe8014e9580f73839aacd527e",
      "statement": "Civil-authority Coverage D requires nearby direct physical loss from a covered cause and an actual prohibition: the HO-3 editions require prohibited access, whereas HO-6 requires prohibited use; payment lasts only while that prohibition is effective and does not extend to mere difficulty, limitation, or an unrelated action.",
